00:27:31,155 --> 00:27:33,816
Binary message formats.

209
00:27:33,816 --> 00:27:42,155
There are several types of binary message formats, but the popular ones are protocol buffers and Avro.

210
00:27:42,276 --> 00:27:52,816
As we said, protocol buffers, they are developed by Google, then they use pack fields, whereas Avro is...

